1
00:00:00,050 --> 00:00:08,945
A plant hormone is an organic substance made in small amounts in one part of a plant, and carried to another part, where it controls some process.

2
00:00:08,945 --> 00:00:11,757
Plants have no glands and no nerves.

3
00:00:11,757 --> 00:00:15,533
Hormones are their entire long-distance messaging system.

4
00:00:15,533 --> 00:00:17,552
There are five classical ones.

